B.R3=s(["I owned mm2, the app the firm's clients use to follow their case, within a 2\u20133 person dev team (App Store and Google Play, about 115 active users). First I maintained the inherited code, then I rebuilt it from scratch with Clean Architecture and BLoC.","The new version brought a clearer design and Firebase push notifications, so clients can see their case status and know when a document arrives.","I automated releases with GitHub Actions (build, signing and upload to the stores): what used to take a day or more of manual work now ships by itself, no Mac needed.","I also built APIs with Laravel, PHP 8.x and MySQL, screens with Vue.js, and automations for the IT team with Google Apps Script (GLPI inventory, Google Workspace user setup, automated reports to the finance chat through Google Chat webhooks). On my own initiative I built ia-sql to speed up their reports."],t.s)
